Nonparametric Multiple Comparisons for relative contrast effects Use nparcomp With STATA 19
----------------------

 ^nparcomp^ var1
 
Description
-----------

^nparcompr^ Nonparametric Multiple Comparisons for relative contrast effects Use nparcomp With STATA 19.
     
Examples
--------

 . ^rcall clear^
 . ^rcall: data<- st.data()r^
 . ^rcall: names(data)^
 . ^rcall: library(nparcomp)^
 . ^rcall: nparcomp <- nparcomp(weight ~ dosage, data = data, asy.method = "probit", type = "Williams", alternative = "two.sided",  plot.simci = TRUE, info = FALSE, correlation = TRUE)^
 . ^rcall: summary(nparcomp)^

